      "promptZhHans": "若函数 \\(f(x) = x^3 + ax^2 + bx + a^2\\) 在 \\(x = 1\\) 处取得极值 \\(10\\)，则 \\(a + b =\\) ______。",
      "optionsZhHans": [],
      "answer": "-7",
      "acceptedAnswers": [
